{"id":301,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Delcatty sleeps anywhere it wants without keeping a permanent nest. If other Pokémon approach it as it sleeps, this Pokémon will never fight—it will just move away somewhere else."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Delcatty prefers to live an unfettered existence in which it can do as it pleases at its own pace. Because this Pokémon eats and sleeps whenever it decides, its daily routines are completely random."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It dislikes dirty places. It often searches for a comfortable place in which to groom itself."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The reason it does not have a nest is that it simply searches for a clean, comfortable place then sleeps there."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"The favorite of trend-conscious female TRAINERS, they are used in competition for their style and fur."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Rather than keeping a permanent lair, it habitually seeks comfortable spots and sleeps there. It is nocturnal and becomes active at dusk."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Cute Charm","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may infatuate attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Normalize","hidden":false,"description":"All the Pokémon’s moves become Normal type. The power of those moves is boosted a little."},{"name":"Wonder Skin","hidden":true,"description":"Makes status moves more likely to miss the Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Fairy"],"genderRate":6,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"Purple","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":300,"name":"Skitty","condition":null,"children":[{"id":301,"name":"Delcatty","condition":"Use Moon Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon","level":[[1,3],[1,47],[1,213],[1,252]],"machine":[213,59,347,451,590,104,138,497,263,218,416,447,237,63,58,371,182,244,240,156,216,496,219,247,214,76,164,241,207,87,86,85,92,528,526],"egg":[],"tutor":[343,215,270,304,196,231,673,387,351,173,707,253,352,428]},"cards":[{"id":"me55c-5","name":"Delcatty","set":"30th Celebration: Classic Collection","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"5","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55c-5/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55c-5/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-166","name":"Delcatty","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"166","artist":"buchi","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-166/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-166/large"},{"id":"sv5-131","name":"Delcatty","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"131","artist":"Keisin","img":"sv5/131"},{"id":"swsh8-211","name":"Delcatty","set":"Fusion Strike","date":"2021-11-12","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"211","artist":"kirisAki","img":"swsh8/211"},{"id":"swsh3-142","name":"Delcatty","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rarity":"Rare","number":"142","artist":"Tika Matsuno","img":"swsh3/142"},{"id":"sm7-121","name":"Delcatty","set":"Celestial Storm","date":"2018-08-03","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"121","artist":"Sekio","img":"sm7/121"},{"id":"smp-SM132","name":"Delcatty","set":"SM Black Star Promos","date":"2017-02-03","rarity":"Promo","number":"SM132","artist":"0313","img":"smp/SM132"},{"id":"xy5-114","name":"Delcatty","set":"Primal Clash","date":"2015-02-04","rarity":"Rare","number":"114","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","img":"xy5/114"},{"id":"xy1-105","name":"Delcatty","set":"XY","date":"2014-02-05","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"105","artist":"Suwama Chiaki","img":"xy1/105"},{"id":"bw7-114","name":"Delcatty","set":"Boundaries Crossed","date":"2012-11-07","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"114","artist":"Shin Nagasawa","img":"bw7/114"},{"id":